From: thanhnguyenwx <thanh.nguyen.wx@bp.renesas.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Dec 2025 13:59:27 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] drpai: add RZ/V DRP-AI character driver

Add the Renesas RZ/V DRP-AI character driver and UAPI.

The driver provides user-space interfaces for buffer assignment,
execution control, reset, status reporting, register dump, and
pre/post-processing parameter updates.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Thanh Nguyen <thanh.nguyen.wx@bp.renesas.com>
Signed-off-by: Tien Nguyen <tien.nguyen.uh@renesas.com>
